      "message": "[warning] Line 124: 🟡 The `.show` assertion is stricter than UIKit’s `show` contract and can fire on valid setups where `rootViewController` is embedded in a navigation stack (`rootViewController.navigationController !\u003d nil`) but is not itself a `UINavigationController`. This can crash debug builds even though navigation would succeed. Prefer asserting on effective navigation availability (e.g., `root as? UINavigationController ?? root.navigationController`) or drop the `.show` nav-root assertion and keep strict checks only for true push-only styles.",
